<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
        }

        .container {
            width: 80%;
            margin: 20px auto;
            border: 1px solid #eee;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .header {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #555;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .cta {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 16px;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            background: #2e7d32;
            color: #fff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .footer {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #777;
            margin-top: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h2>Confirm return receipt</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello {{curatorName}},</p>
            <p>The return for order <strong>{{orderNumber}}</strong> was delivered. Confirm receipt in the app to complete the order and release funds.</p>

            {{#if trackingNumber}}
            <p><strong>Tracking:</strong> {{trackingNumber}}</p>
            {{/if}}

            <p><a class="cta" href="{{orderPageUrl}}" target="_blank">Confirm return receipt</a></p>

            <p style="font-size:14px;color:#555;">After you confirm, collateral returns to the renter and your earnings are credited to your wallet.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} {{platformName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
